        "en": "The Question",
        "es": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]",
        "pt": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]"
      },
      "script": {
        "en": "Anyone can talk about a topic. But causing genuine understanding in another person is an art. What makes teaching actually work?",
